# Billing

- Tenant = Organization; one active subscription
- `IBillingProvider`: Stripe or Mock; never store raw cards
- Webhooks idempotent (`WebhookEvent` dedupe)
- Never trust client-claimed plan/entitlements
- Past due → grace → read-only → lock except Billing+Auth
- Seat/branch/module checks on invite and module access
